%h2 Welcome to Action.IO

- if @invite.inviting_user.present?
  %p= "User #{@invite.inviting_user.username} has invited you to Action.IO"

%p Action.IO is a cloud development platform that provides a lightning fast way to setup and manage development envirionments in the cloud. Please click the following link to activate your account:

:ruby
  _reg_url = new_user_registration_url(email: @invite.email, invite_code: @invite.invite_code)

%p=link_to _reg_url, _reg_url

%p We're currently in private beta, so please don't hesitate to get in touch with feedback.

%p
  Action.IO
  %br
  = link_to "http://action.io", "http://www.action.io"
